{%- comment -%}
  Hanging rail (templates round 24, reworked in round 25). A clothing rail: a
  metal rail across the section and the shop's garments on hangers hanging
  from it side on, each with a small price tag. Each garment is a block
  linked to a product, with two cut-out pictures of it on its hanger: a
  side view, shown on the rail, and a front view, shown when the visitor
  points at it. A back view can be added; it is only downloaded when
  someone asks to see it.

  On a computer the garment under the pointer turns from its side to face
  the visitor while its neighbours move aside, and the hangers swing a
  little as the pointer brushes past or the rail moves. Its name shows
  under the rail. Clicking it lifts it off the rail into a focus view (a
  window on a computer, a sheet from the bottom on a phone): the garment
  flies from its hanger to the left of the window, with its title, price,
  options, Add to cart, the pieces it is worn with, a link to the product
  page and arrows to step along the rail. Closing it is the same movement
  backwards: the garment flies back onto its hanger while the window fades,
  and the page can be used again at once. Either can be interrupted.

  Colours, fonts, buttons and corners are the theme's: the section takes a
  colour scheme, the focus view takes the same scheme, the buttons are the
  theme's buttons and the corners follow the theme's corner radius. Each
  colour can be set apart from the scheme.

  Geometry comes from settings alone (the height of a garment, the room for
  it, the gap), never from a picture's size, so nothing moves while
  pictures load. One script, inline, the same text for every rail: it
  defines <hanging-rail> once, and each rail, also one the editor adds or
  redraws, starts itself when it is put on the page. Its animation loop
  runs only while something is still moving.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign st = section.settings
  assign sid = section.id
  assign count = section.blocks.size
  assign scheme = st.color_scheme.id | default: st.color_scheme | default: 'default-color-scheme'
  assign gh = st.garment_height | default: 300
  assign gh_m = st.garment_height_mobile | default: 210
  assign ratio = st.garment_width | default: 50
  assign slot = gh | times: ratio | divided_by: 100
  assign slot_m = gh_m | times: ratio | divided_by: 100
  assign side_1x = gh | times: 45 | divided_by: 100
  assign side_2x = side_1x | times: 2
  assign front_1x = gh | times: 8 | divided_by: 10
  assign front_2x = front_1x | times: 2
  assign fit = false
  if st.overflow == 'fit'
    assign fit = true
  endif
  assign picture = false
  if st.background_style == 'picture'
    assign picture = true
  endif
  assign shop_link = st.button_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
  assign add_label = 'products.product.actions.add_to_cart.default.label' | t
  assign sold_label = 'products.product.actions.add_to_cart.sold_out.label' | t
  assign button_style = st.button_style | default: 'secondary'
-%}
<style>
  .hr { --hr-gh: var(--hr-gh-m); --hr-slot-base: calc(var(--hr-gh) * var(--hr-ratio)); --hr-slot: var(--hr-slot-base); --hr-edge: 16px; --hr-radius: var(--rounded-radius, 12px); position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--hr-bg); color: var(--hr-fg); padding: var(--hr-pt-m) 0 var(--hr-pb-m); font-family: var(--body-font, inherit); }
  @media (min-width: 750px) { .hr { --hr-gh: var(--hr-gh-d); --hr-edge: 32px; padding: var(--hr-pt) 0 var(--hr-pb); } }
  .hr__bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .hr__bg img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: var(--hr-focus-x, 50%) var(--hr-focus-y, 50%); display: block; }
  .hr--blur .hr__bg img { filter: blur(var(--hr-blur)); transform: scale(1.06); }
  .hr__bg::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--hr-shade); opacity: var(--hr-shade-o); }
  .hr > :not(.hr__bg) { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .hr__head { text-align: center; padding: 0 var(--hr-edge); margin: 0 auto var(--hr-head-gap, 0); max-width: 1100px; }
  .hr__eyebrow { margin: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; color: var(--hr-fg); }
  .hr__eyebrow span + span { padding-left: 12px; border-left: 1px solid currentColor; opacity: .6; font-weight: 500; }
  .hr__heading { margin: 14px 0 0; color: var(--hr-heading); font-family: var(--heading-font, inherit); font-weight: var(--heading-weight, 600); text-transform: var(--heading-text-transform, none); font-size: var(--hr-h-m); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: var(--heading-letter-spacing, -.01em); }
  @media (min-width: 750px) { .hr__heading { font-size: var(--hr-h); } }
  .hr__eyebrow:empty, .hr__heading:empty { display: none; }
  /* Over a picture, the words sit on a pane of frosted glass in the scheme's own colours, so they read on any picture. */
  .hr--glass .hr__head > *, .hr--glass .hr__caption { position: relative; }
  .hr--glass .hr__head { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .hr--glass .hr__pane { display: inline-flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; max-width: 100%; padding: 14px 26px 16px; border-radius: var(--hr-radius); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hr-bg-solid) var(--hr-glass-o), transparent); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(1.2); backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(1.2); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 color-mix(in srgb, #fff 35%, transparent) inset, 0 10px 30px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .hr--glass .hr__caption .hr__pane { gap: 12px; padding: 14px 22px; }
  .hr:not(.hr--glass) .hr__pane { display: contents; }

  /* The stage: the rail, the row that scrolls, its arrows. Every size is a setting, so nothing moves while pictures arrive. */
  hanging-rail.hr__stage { display: block; position: relative; container-type: inline-size; padding-top: var(--hr-rail-y); }
  .hr--fit hanging-rail.hr__stage { --hr-fit-slot: calc((100cqw - 2 * var(--hr-edge) - (var(--hr-n) - 1) * var(--hr-gap)) / var(--hr-n)); }
  @media (min-width: 750px) { .hr--fit hanging-rail.hr__stage { --hr-slot: min(var(--hr-slot-base), var(--hr-fit-slot)); } }
  .hr__stage { --hr-ghx: calc(var(--hr-slot) / var(--hr-ratio)); }
  .hr__rod { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: calc(var(--hr-rail-y) + var(--hr-ghx) * .018); height: var(--hr-rail-t); border-radius: 99px; background: var(--hr-rod); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18); pointer-events: none; }
  .hr__rod::before, .hr__rod::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 50%; width: 18px; height: calc(var(--hr-rail-t) + 12px); transform: translateY(-50%); background: var(--hr-rod); border-radius: 2px; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.2); }
  .hr__rod::before { left: 6px; } .hr__rod::after { right: 6px; }
  .hr--no-brackets .hr__rod::before, .hr--no-brackets .hr__rod::after { display: none; }
  .hr__scroller { position: relative; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden; scrollbar-width: none; overscroll-behavior-x: contain; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; padding-bottom: calc(var(--hr-ghx) * .08); }
  .hr__scroller::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .hr__scroller.is-dragging { cursor: grabbing; user-select: none; }
  .hr__track { list-style: none; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--hr-edge); display: flex; gap: var(--hr-gap); width: max-content; min-width: 0; }
  .hr__item { position: relative; flex: 0 0 var(--hr-slot); width: var(--hr-slot); height: calc(var(--hr-ghx) * 1.06); margin: 0; will-change: transform; }
  .hr__g { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; outline: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; cursor: pointer; }
  /* Keyboard focus: a short bar under the garment, which stays put while the garment turns and swings. */
  .hr__g::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: calc(var(--hr-ghx) * var(--hr-k, 1) + 8px); width: 28px; height: 2px; margin-left: -14px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--hr-heading); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .2s; }
  .hr__g:focus-visible::after { opacity: 1; }
  .hr__swing { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: calc(var(--hr-ghx) * var(--hr-k, 1)); transform-origin: 50% 2%; }
  /* Lifted off the rail into the focus view: the hanger is empty until the garment flies back. */
  .hr__item.is-lifted .hr__swing { visibility: hidden; }
  .hr__side, .hr__front, .hr__blank { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; height: 100%; max-width: none; transform: translateX(-50%); transform-origin: 50% 0; pointer-events: none; -webkit-user-drag: none; user-select: none; object-fit: contain; object-position: 50% 0; }
  /* A side view keeps its own width at the garment's height, so it hangs at the scale of its front view: hook over hook, hem level with hem. */
  .hr__side { width: auto; }
  .hr__front { width: calc(var(--hr-ghx) * var(--hr-k, 1)); }
  .hr__front { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-50%) perspective(900px) rotateY(-74deg); }
  /* No side view: the front view hangs turned a little away, and turns to face the visitor. */
  .hr__front.hr__front--rest { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) perspective(1100px) rotateY(var(--hr-rest)); }
  hanging-rail.is-live .hr__side, hanging-rail.is-live .hr__front { will-change: transform, opacity; }
  .hr__blank { width: calc(var(--hr-ghx) * .5); color: currentColor; opacity: .5; }
  .hr__tag { position: absolute; top: calc(var(--hr-ghx) * .02 + var(--hr-rail-t)); left: calc(50% + 4px); display: block; transform-origin: 2px 0; transform: rotate(-4deg); pointer-events: none; }
  .hr__tag::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 2px; top: -10px; height: 12px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.45); }
  .hr__tag span { display: block; margin-top: 2px; padding: 3px 6px 3px 9px; background: var(--hr-tag-bg); color: var(--hr-tag-fg); font-family: var(--body-font, inherit); font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .01em; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 2px; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.22); position: relative; }
  .hr__tag span::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 3px; top: 50%; width: 3px; height: 3px; margin-top: -1.5px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; opacity: .35; }
  .hr--no-tags .hr__tag { display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 749px) { .hr__tag span { font-size: 9px; padding: 2px 5px 2px 8px; } }
  .hr__arrow { position: absolute; top: calc(var(--hr-rail-y) + var(--hr-ghx) * .45); z-index: 3; width: 48px; height: 48px; margin-top: -24px; border: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; color: var(--hr-fg); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s, transform .25s; }
  .hr__arrow svg { width: 30px; height: 30px; filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.18)); }
  .hr__arrow--prev { left: 8px; } .hr__arrow--next { right: 8px; }
  .hr__arrow[disabled] { opacity: 0 !important; pointer-events: none; }
  hanging-rail.is-scrollable .hr__arrow { display: inline-flex; }
  hanging-rail.is-scrollable:hover .hr__arrow, hanging-rail.is-scrollable:focus-within .hr__arrow { opacity: .85; }
  .hr__arrow:hover { opacity: 1 !important; transform: scale(1.06); }
  @media (hover: none) { .hr__arrow { display: none !important; } }

  /* Under the rail: the name of the garment in front, or the section's own line, and the button. */
  .hr__caption { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 18px var(--hr-edge) 0; text-align: center; }
  .hr__lines { position: relative; display: grid; min-height: 1.5em; width: 100%; max-width: 640px; }
  .hr__lines > * { grid-area: 1 / 1; margin: 0; transition: opacity .25s ease, transform .25s ease; }
  .hr__name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); color: var(--hr-heading); min-width: 0; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 1.5; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  /* The name and the line under the rail share one cell: the cell is as tall as the taller of the two, and the name is one line, so pointing at garments never moves anything below. */
  .hr__name small { font-weight: 400; opacity: .7; margin-left: 8px; font-size: inherit; }
  .hr__text { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .hr__text > * { margin: 0; }
  .hr.is-showing .hr__name { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .hr.is-showing .hr__text { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .hr__button--link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; color: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity .2s; }
  .hr__button--link:hover { opacity: .7; }
  .hr--split .hr__caption { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: end; gap: 12px 32px; text-align: left; }
  .hr--split .hr__lines, .hr--split .hr__caption .hr__pane { display: contents; }
  .hr--split .hr__name { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / span 2; align-self: end; }
  .hr--split .hr__name small { display: inline; margin: 0 0 0 8px; }
  .hr--split .hr__name:not(:empty) { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .hr--split .hr__text { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; text-align: right; justify-self: end; max-width: 34ch; }
  .hr--split.is-showing .hr__text { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .hr--split .hr__button { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; justify-self: end; }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .hr--split .hr__caption { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .hr--split .hr__name { grid-row: 1; }
    .hr--split .hr__text { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; text-align: left; justify-self: start; }
    .hr--split .hr__button { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 3; justify-self: start; }
  }
  /* Split, over a picture on glass: one pane at the right, the garment's name taking the line's place as in the centred layout. */
  .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__caption { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__caption .hr__pane { display: inline-flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; text-align: right; max-width: min(440px, 100%); }
  .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__lines { display: grid; }
  .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__name, .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__text { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; justify-self: end; max-width: none; }
  .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__name { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
  .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__name small { display: inline; margin: 0 0 0 8px; }
  .hr--glass.hr--split.is-showing .hr__name { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .hr--glass.hr--split.is-showing .hr__text { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
  @media (max-width: 749px) { .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__caption { justify-content: center; } .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__caption .hr__pane { align-items: center; text-align: center; } .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__name, .hr--glass.hr--split .hr__text { justify-self: center; } }
  .hr__empty { margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px var(--hr-edge); text-align: center; font-size: 14px; opacity: .7; }

  /* The focus view: one per page, in <body>, a window on a computer and a sheet on a phone. It wears the rail's colour scheme. */
  .hr-focus { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 90; color: var(--color-text); font-family: var(--body-font, inherit); }
  /* The scheme's class paints its background on whatever wears it: the window's own layers paint it instead, so it can fade. */
  .hr-focus[class] { background: none; }
  .hr-focus[hidden] { display: none; }
  .hr-focus.is-closing { pointer-events: none; }
  .hr-focus__backdrop { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--hrf-bg); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .34s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1); }
  .hr-focus--glass .hr-focus__backdrop { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hrf-bg) 80%, transparent); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(26px) saturate(1.15); backdrop-filter: blur(26px) saturate(1.15); }
  .hr-focus.is-open .hr-focus__backdrop { opacity: 1; }
  .hr-focus__panel { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(300px, 420px); align-items: center; gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 80px); padding: 64px clamp(56px, 8vw, 140px) 48px; outline: none; }
  .hr-focus__media { position: relative; height: min(76vh, 760px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .hr-focus__img { max-height: 100%; max-width: 100%; width: auto; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; transition: opacity .25s ease; }
  .hr-focus__img.is-hidden { opacity: 0; }
  .hr-focus__img.is-flying { visibility: hidden; transition: none; }
  .hr-focus__info { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); transition: opacity .3s ease, transform .3s ease; max-height: 100%; overflow: auto; padding: 4px; scrollbar-width: none; }
  /* Scrolls when it must, with no scroll bar showing (wheel, touch and keys still scroll it). */
  .hr-focus__info::-webkit-scrollbar, .hr-focus__panel::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .hr-focus.is-open .hr-focus__info { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition-delay: .1s; }
  .hr-focus__chrome { opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s ease; }
  .hr-focus.is-open .hr-focus__chrome { opacity: .75; }
  .hr-focus.is-open .hr-focus__chrome:hover { opacity: 1; }
  .hr-focus__count { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; opacity: .6; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .hr-focus__title { margin: 0; font-family: var(--heading-font, inherit); font-weight: var(--heading-weight, 600); text-transform: var(--heading-text-transform, none); letter-spacing: var(--heading-letter-spacing, 0); font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 30px); line-height: 1.15; color: var(--color-heading); }
  .hr-focus__price { margin: 8px 0 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-heading); }
  .hr-focus__price s { font-weight: 400; opacity: .55; font-size: 14px; }
  .hr-focus__note { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; opacity: .8; }
  .hr-focus__views { display: flex; gap: 18px; margin: 18px 0 0; }
  .hr-focus__views button { border: 0; background: none; padding: 4px 0; color: inherit; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; opacity: .55; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; }
  .hr-focus__views button[aria-selected="true"] { opacity: 1; border-bottom-color: currentColor; }
  .hr-focus__option { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0 0; min-width: 0; }
  .hr-focus__option legend { padding: 0; margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .65; }
  .hr-focus__values { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .hr-focus__value { min-width: 44px; height: 44px; padding: 0 12px; border: var(--btn-border-width, 1px) solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 22%, transparent); border-radius: var(--btn-radius, 99px); background: none; color: var(--color-text); font: inherit; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s; }
  .hr-focus__value:hover { border-color: var(--color-text); }
  .hr-focus__value[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--btn-primary-bg-color, var(--color-heading)); border-color: var(--btn-primary-bg-color, var(--color-heading)); color: var(--btn-primary-color, var(--color-background)); }
  .hr-focus__value.is-out { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: .45; }
  .hr-focus__form { display: block; margin-top: 22px; }
  .hr-focus__add { width: 100%; min-height: 50px; }
  .hr-focus__add .hr-focus__label { display: inline-grid; }
  .hr-focus__add .hr-focus__label > * { grid-area: 1 / 1; transition: opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
  .hr-focus__add .hr-focus__done { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .hr-focus__add.is-added .hr-focus__idle { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); }
  .hr-focus__add.is-added .hr-focus__done { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .hr-focus__add.is-busy .hr-focus__label { opacity: .55; }
  .hr-focus__add.is-busy::after { content: ""; position: absolute; right: 18px; top: 50%; width: 14px; height: 14px; margin-top: -7px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid currentColor; border-right-color: transparent; animation: hr-spin .7s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes hr-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .hr-focus__cart { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-heading); text-underline-offset: 4px; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: opacity .25s ease, visibility 0s .25s; }
  .hr-focus__cart.is-shown { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transition: opacity .25s ease; }
  .hr-focus__with { margin-top: 24px; }
  .hr-focus__with h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; opacity: .65; font-family: inherit; color: inherit; }
  .hr-focus__with ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .hr-focus__pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 12%, transparent); border-radius: var(--rounded-radius, 10px); }
  .hr-focus__pair img { width: 56px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: calc(var(--rounded-radius, 10px) * .6); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 5%, var(--color-background)); display: block; }
  .hr-focus__pair a { color: var(--color-heading); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; display: block; }
  .hr-focus__pair a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .hr-focus__pair small { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-size: 13px; opacity: .75; }
  .hr-focus__plus { width: 40px; height: 40px; border: var(--btn-border-width, 1px) solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 22%, transparent); border-radius: var(--btn-radius, 99px); background: none; color: var(--color-text); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s; }
  .hr-focus__plus:hover { border-color: var(--color-text); }
  .hr-focus__plus.is-added { background: var(--btn-primary-bg-color, var(--color-heading)); border-color: var(--btn-primary-bg-color, var(--color-heading)); color: var(--btn-primary-color, var(--color-background)); }
  .hr-focus__plus[disabled] { opacity: .4; cursor: default; }
  .hr-focus__plus svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
  .hr-focus__foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-top: 26px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 14%, transparent); font-size: 13px; }
  .hr-focus__foot a { color: var(--color-heading); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .hr-focus__foot a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
